      "question": "<p>A particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> moves with acceleration <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(4\\mathbf i-5\\mathbf j)\\,\\mathrm{m\\,s^{-2}}\"></span></p><p>At time <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t=0\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> is moving with velocity <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-2\\mathbf i+2\\mathbf j)\\,\\mathrm{m\\,s^{-1}}\"></span></p><ol class=\"parts\"><li>Find the velocity of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> at time <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t=2\"></span> seconds. <span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></li></ol><p>At time <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t=0\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> passes through the origin <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"O\"></span>.</p><p>At time <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t=T\"></span> seconds, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"T&gt;0\"></span>, the particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> passes through the point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\"></span>.</p><p>The position vector of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\"></span> is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(\\lambda\\mathbf i-4.5\\mathbf j)\\,\\mathrm m\"></span> relative to <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"O\"></span>, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda\"></span> is a constant.</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"2\"><li>Find the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"T\"></span>. <span class=\"marks\">(4)</span></li><li>Hence find the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda\"></span> <span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></li></ol>",
