      "question": "<ol class=\"parts\" type=\"i\"><li>At time <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t\"></span> seconds, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t\\geqslant 0\"></span>, a particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> moves so that its acceleration <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf a\\,\\mathrm{m\\,s^{-2}}\"></span> is given by<div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf a=(1-4t)\\mathbf i+\\left(3-t^2\\right)\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"true\"></div>At the instant when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t=0\"></span>, the velocity of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"36\\mathbf i\\,\\mathrm{m\\,s^{-1}}\"></span><ol class=\"parts\"><li>Find the velocity of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t=4\"></span> <span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></li><li>Find the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t\"></span> at the instant when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> is moving in a direction perpendicular to <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf i\"></span> <span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></li></ol></li><li>At time <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t\"></span> seconds, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t\\geqslant 0\"></span>, a particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"Q\"></span> moves so that its position vector <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf r\"></span> metres, relative to a fixed origin <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"O\"></span>, is given by<div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf r=\\left(t^2-t\\right)\\mathbf i+3t\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"true\"></div>Find the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t\"></span> at the instant when the speed of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"Q\"></span> is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"5\\,\\mathrm{m\\,s^{-1}}\"></span> <span class=\"marks\">(6)</span></li></ol>",
